{"id":"lw2dmmbsjjcps9oaotpavzq1c","title":"币安更新大宗商品期权结算价规则，11月23日起生效","originalTitle":null,"summary":"币安宣布更新大宗商品期权结算价规则，11月23日起生效。新规则将结算价改为到期前0.5小时币安期货指数的算术平均值，原规则为到期日标的市场收盘价。仅合约到期时间决定适用规则，2026年11月23日及之后到期的期权均适用新规。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"PANews"},"links":{"original":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1ce58-c46f-72eb-aebd-9e194cbf7137"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T06:01:26.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T06:10:07.318Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T06:10:07.318Z","category":"crypto-market","tags":["数据发布","大宗商品","Binance"],"score":62,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"binance","name":"Binance / 币安"},{"slug":"commodities","name":"大宗商品"},{"slug":"data","name":"数据发布"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}